{"source":"Lecture slides footer; rules.txt: schedule","chroma:document":"contact\nEmail: m.saleem@duet.edu.pk (the address on his slides). Mr. Saleem teaches 18 to 20 classroom hours a week and also handles counseling and FYDP mentorship, so his free window is only about 3 to 4 hours weekly. For anything personal (letters, medical reviews, FYDP guidance) visit during his counseling/office hours."